'''Chroma Vampire's Gun''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun previously obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Halloween Box]] in the [[Halloween Event 2024|2024 Halloween Event]]. This item is, however, no longer obtainable since the event has ended and can only be obtained through the trading system.

==Appearance==
Chroma Vampire's Gun is a chroma variant of the [[Vampire's Gun]]. Chroma Vampire's Gun changes color when equipping the gun, or a solid multicolor when using the “/chromatoggle” command. Similar to various other chromas. Furthermore, the Vampire's Gun has a swirled blood look, with a gold outlining, while this is the chroma variant being fully chroma.

==Trivia==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Vampire's Gun]], which can be found in the same box.
*It is the tenth holiday chroma and the fifth Halloween chroma to be released in the game, the others being [[Chroma Evergreen]], [[Chroma Evergun]], [[Chroma Traveler's Gun]], [[Chroma Cookiecane]], [[Chroma Elderwood Blade]], [[Chroma Swirly Gun]], [[Chroma Candleflame]], [[Chroma Gingerblade]], and [[Chroma Boneblade]].
*This is the fourth holiday chroma gun to be released, with the first being [[Chroma Swirly Gun]].
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

